      "at": "2026-08-07T09:44:28.737940Z",
      "pattern": "src/scistudio/engine/runners/worker.py",
      "reason": "Scope beyond the dispatch write set, declared before commit. (1) src/scistudio/engine/runners/worker.py: P1-1's divergence physically lives here. The dispatch located the worker's sys.path injection at blocks/registry/__init__.py:521 (BlockRegistry.instantiate), but the worker never calls instantiate - it calls its own _prepend_runtime_import_roots (worker.py:96), which inserts the stamped type roots permanently. The shared guard is called from both; without the worker call site the P1-1 reproduction still fails. (2) tests/api/test_blocks.py, tests/api/test_reload_on_save.py, tests/ai/test_mcp_tools_authoring.py: consequences of the P2 route change the dispatch asked for (POST /api/blocks/reload and the save hook now call refresh_all_registries instead of block_registry.hot_reload, which builds a fresh registry rather than re-scanning the existing object). Each test's spy or ad-hoc scan dir had to move to the new entry point."
